# React Native Real-time Rules

- One singleton connection per endpoint in `packages/ws-client` or `apps/mobile/src/services/ws`.
- Components subscribe through hooks; never open sockets in components.
- Expose `idle`, `connecting`, `live`, `reconnecting`, `offline`, `degraded`.
- Backoff with jitter; heartbeat every 15-30 seconds while foregrounded.
- Pause/downgrade non-critical streams in background; reconcile on foreground.
- Validate inbound frames with zod and strip PII from logs.
- Batch high-rate frames and cap non-game UI at 30 fps.
